  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">We’re a trendy clothing brand focused on cute, confident, and expressive pieces 🤍<br>Our designs are inspired by girly aesthetics, streetwear, and viral internet culture—made for girls who want to stand out and feel like <em>that girl.</em></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><em>From statement tees to everyday staples, our goal is to create pieces you’ll actually want to wear and post 💕</em></p><p>What makes us different is our ability to blend girly aesthetics with bold, viral-style designs 🤍</p><p>Our pieces aren’t just clothes—they’re made to stand out, get attention, and feel current with what’s trending online.</p><p><br></p><p>We focus on creating designs people actually want to wear and post, making it easier for our affiliates to promote and sell 💕</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br></p><p>Affiliates earn commission every time someone shops using their personal code or link 🤍</p><p>Simply share your code on TikTok, Instagram, or anywhere you post—when someone makes a purchase, you get paid 💕</p><p><br></p><p>The more you promote, the more you earn 👀</p><p><br></p><p><br></p></div></div>",
